            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/603140/extras/5e1ef6cacbb946eaeb393c55bbe76fc3.avif?t=1604630173\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong>Type:</strong> Visual Novel <br><strong>Language:</strong> English<br><strong>Genre:</strong> Thriller, Mystery, fantasy<br><strong>Duration:</strong> Approximately 6 hours<br><strong>Public:</strong> +15<br><strong>Platforms:</strong> Windows, Linux, Mac<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis:</h2><br>Shortly after moving out Gary has a strange dream where he meets a woman who responds to the name of Alice, who tells him he left a promise unfulfilled. That would be the beginning of a series of inexplicable events that will take him to visit different dreamlike places and to meet people he can’t remember ever seeing before.",
