                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "237553823",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198412752504",
                            "num_reviews": 2,
                            "playtime_forever": 5029,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 5029,
                            "last_played": 1791816532
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I loved so much of this game with every fiber of my body. \nTo be honest, I only played the game because I wanted to improve my English level at the start, and it was a challenge for me to comprehend a full story just by reading it\nBut it totally surprised me, the whole story was so amazing, and the characters were really good also (especially Henry, he was a really cool concept of a character to me, I really cry with him in the story a lot)\nAnd it was so beautiful to obtain all the endings in the game especially the last ones (I'm still sad because of the endings btw)\nIt was so sad when I saw that the studio had not been making games for years. because I really hope to play more games like this. Well, at least they made a really good game like this, so I'm thankful to them\nAlso, it was my first game in which I obtained all the trophies, so I'm happy about that\n\nIf you love good stories with good characters, try this game; you won 't regret it!\n\nA personal anecdote of mine involving this game: This game was my first game when I downloaded Steam years ago, when I got my first PC. Probably because of that, I have a special place in my heart. Also, years ago it inspired me to study English, and now, years later, I finally play the full game (those years I couldn't do it), which is still helping me with that. I saved this game in a special side of my heart!",
